    <string name="shortcut_conditions">Conditions</string>
    <string name="shortcut_conditions_hint">The rule runs only when every condition holds; a condition holds when the current value is one of those chosen. Values come from what DiPlay already follows. A car value that cannot be read does not hold; right after connecting, a trigger waits up to 1.5 s for it. All rules for the same trigger whose conditions hold run, in list order, and a new trigger interrupts a rule still running.</string>
    <string name="shortcut_condition_none">No conditions: runs whenever the trigger fires.</string>
    <string name="shortcut_add_condition">Add condition</string>
    <string name="shortcut_condition_values_hint">Choose one or more values. The condition holds when the current value is any of them.</string>
