    <string name="shortcut_right_card_wait">Right card: wait for the map</string>
    <string name="shortcut_right_card_wait_ms">%1$d ms</string>
    <string name="shortcut_right_card_wait_none">No wait</string>
    <string name="shortcut_right_card_wait_hint">Applies to all rules. When a right card appears, the dashboard can send its map signal up to half a second later; the wait tells a plain card from the map. With no wait, \"right card shown\" runs at once, and a map card that turns out to be the map also runs \"right map card shown\" right after. A door card over the map, and the map coming back, always run at once.</string>
